{"took": 1, "timed_out": false, "_shards": {"total": 20, "successful": 20, "skipped": 0, "failed": 0}, "hits": {"total": 1, "max_score": 10.208518, "hits": [{"_index": "dhids_oldbailey_record", "_type": "doc", "_id": "AYxELtfBPld_y58RzzA0", "_score": 10.208518, "_source": {"metadata": "<table xmlns:dhids=\"https://www.dhi.ac.uk/data/\" class=\"table small\"><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Text type</th><td>Trial account</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Defendants</th><td>CAROLINE AGNES JOLLIFFE DYER,</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Offences</th><td><a href=\"../about/crimes#killing\">Killing</a> &gt; <a href=\"../about/crimes#murder\">Murder</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Session Date</th><td><a href=\"t19010910#t19010910-641\">10th September 1901</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Reference Number</th><td>t19010910-641</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Verdicts</th><td><a href=\"../about/verdicts#miscellaneousverdicts\">Miscellaneous Verdict</a> &gt; <a href=\"../about/verdicts#unfittoplead\">Unfit to plead</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Punishments</th><td><a href=\"../about/punishment#imprisonment\">Imprisonment</a> &gt; <a href=\"../about/punishment#imprisonment-insanity\">Insanity</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Navigation</th><td><a href=\"t19010910-640\">&lt; Previous section (Trial account)</a> | <a href=\"t19010910-642\">Next section (Trial account) &gt;</a></td></tr></tbody></table>", "images": ["https://www.dhi.ac.uk/san/ccc/19010910/190109100055.jpg"], "exturl": "https://www.oldbaileyonline.org/browse.jsp?div=t19010910-641", "citation": "<span><i>Old Bailey Proceedings Online</i> (www.oldbaileyonline.org, version 9.0) September 1901. Trial of CAROLINE AGNES JOLLIFFE DYER, (t19010910-641).</span>", "project": "oldbailey", "collection": "record", "title": "CAROLINE AGNES JOLLIFFE DYER,. Killing; murder. 10th September 1901.", "image_titles": ["Proceedings of the Central Criminal Court, 10th September ."], "idkey": "t19010910-641", "navigation": "<span><a href=\"t19010910-640\">&lt; Previous section (Trial account)</a> | <a href=\"t19010910-642\">Next section (Trial account) &gt;</a></span>", "xml": "<div1 type=\"trialAccount\" id=\"t19010910-641\"> <interp inst=\"t19010910-641\" type=\"prevdiv\" value=\"t19010910-640\" divtype=\"trialAccount\"/> <interp inst=\"t19010910-641\" type=\"nextdiv\" value=\"t19010910-642\" divtype=\"trialAccount\"/> <interp inst=\"t19010910-641\" type=\"div0\" value=\"t19010910\" divtype=\"sessionsPaper\"/> <interp inst=\"t19010910-641\" type=\"uri\" value=\"sessionsPapers/19010910\"/> <interp inst=\"t19010910-641\" type=\"date\" value=\"19010910\"/> <xptr imgpath=\"ccc/19010910/190109100055.jpg\" imgtitle=\"Proceedings of the Central Criminal Court, 10th September .\" imgrights=\"Copyright in this image is owned by the 'Old Bailey Online' project. Non-commercial and fair use of this image is allowed without further consent. Commercial use is prohibited without explicit permission from the project.\" type=\"pageFacsimile\" value=\"preceding\" doc=\"190109100055\"/> <join result=\"criminalCharge\" id=\"t19010910-641-charge-1\" targOrder=\"Y\" targets=\"def1-641-19010910 t19010910-641-offence-1 t19010910-641-verdict-1\"/> <p>641. <hi rend=\"italic\">In the case of</hi> <persName id=\"def1-641-19010910\" type=\"defendantName\"> <interp inst=\"def1-641-19010910\" type=\"gender\" value=\"female\"/> <interp inst=\"def1-641-19010910\" type=\"surname\" value=\"DYER,\"/> <interp inst=\"def1-641-19010910\" type=\"given\" value=\"CAROLINE AGNES JOLLIFFE\"/> <hi rend=\"largeCaps\">CAROLINE AGNES JOLLIFFE DYER,</hi> </persName> <rs id=\"t19010910-641-offence-1\" type=\"offenceDescription\"> <interp inst=\"t19010910-641-offence-1\" type=\"offenceCategory\" value=\"kill\"/> <interp inst=\"t19010910-641-offence-1\" type=\"offenceSubcategory\" value=\"murder\"/> <hi rend=\"italic\">indicted, with <persName id=\"t19010910-name-263\"> <interp inst=\"t19010910-name-263\" type=\"gender\" value=\"male\"/> <interp inst=\"t19010910-name-263\" type=\"surname\" value=\"DYER\"/> <interp inst=\"t19010910-name-263\" type=\"given\" value=\"RALPH JOHN\"/>Ralph John Dyer<interp inst=\"t19010910-name-263\" type=\"age\" value=\"unknown\"/> </persName>, for murder;</hi> </rs> <rs id=\"t19010910-641-verdict-1\" type=\"verdictDescription\"> <interp inst=\"t19010910-641-verdict-1\" type=\"verdictCategory\" value=\"miscVerdict\"/> <interp inst=\"t19010910-641-verdict-1\" type=\"plea\" value=\"unfitToPlead\"/> <interp inst=\"t19010910-641-verdict-1\" type=\"verdictSubcategory\" value=\"unfitToPlead\"/> <hi rend=\"italic\">on the evidence of</hi> <hi rend=\"smallCaps\">DR. BASTIAN, DR. MAUDSLEY</hi> <hi rend=\"italic\">and</hi> <hi rend=\"smallCaps\">DR. SCOTT</hi>, <hi rend=\"italic\">the Medical Officer at Holloway, the</hi> <hi rend=\"smallCaps\">JURY</hi> <hi rend=\"italic\">found that the prisoner was insane and unable to plead.</hi> </rs>\u2014<hi rend=\"italic\"> <rs id=\"t19010910-641-punishment-58\" type=\"punishmentDescription\"> <interp inst=\"t19010910-641-punishment-58\" type=\"punishmentCategory\" value=\"imprison\"/> <interp inst=\"t19010910-641-punishment-58\" type=\"punishmentSubcategory\" value=\"insanity\"/> <join result=\"defendantPunishment\" targOrder=\"Y\" targets=\"def1-641-19010910 t19010910-641-punishment-58\"/>To be detained during His Majesty's pleasure.</rs> </hi> (<hi rend=\"italic\">See next case.</hi>)</p> </div1>", "html": "<div> <p>641. <i>In the case of</i> <span class=\"largeCaps\">CAROLINE AGNES JOLLIFFE DYER,</span> <i>indicted, with Ralph John Dyer , for murder;</i> <i>on the evidence of</i> <span class=\"smallCaps\">DR. BASTIAN, DR. MAUDSLEY</span> <i>and</i> <span class=\"smallCaps\">DR. SCOTT</span>, <i>the Medical Officer at Holloway, the</i> <span class=\"smallCaps\">JURY</span> <i>found that the prisoner was insane and unable to plead.</i> &#x2014;<i> To be detained during His Majesty's pleasure. </i> (<i>See next case.</i>)</p> </div>", "text": "641. In the case of CAROLINE AGNES JOLLIFFE DYER, indicted, with Ralph John Dyer , for murder; on the evidence of DR. BASTIAN, DR. MAUDSLEY and DR. SCOTT, the Medical Officer at Holloway, the JURY found that the prisoner was insane and unable to plead. \u2014 To be detained during His Majesty's pleasure. (See next case.)", "image_rights": ["Copyright in this image is owned by the 'Old Bailey Online' project. Non-commercial and fair use of this image is allowed without further consent. Commercial use is prohibited without explicit permission from the project."]}}]}}